<in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock contextRef="OneD">Notes:    1. The Statement include the unaudited results of H.G. Infra Engineering Limited (including 3 jointly controlled operation) and 9 subsidiaries (the Holding Company, its subsidiaries together referred to as  the Group ). This Statement has been prepared in accordance with the Companies (Indian Accounting Standards) Rules, 2015 (Ind AS) prescribed under Section 133 of the Companies Act, 2013 and other recognised accounting practices and policies to the extent applicable.   2. The above Statement of unaudited Consolidated financial results for the quarter and nine months period ended 31.12.2022 have been reviewed by the Audit Committee and approved by the Board of Directors at its meetings held on 08.02.2023. The Joint Statutory Auditors of the Company have carried out limited review of the above consolidated financial results pursuant to Regulation 33 and 52 of the SEBI (LODR) Regulations, 2015 and have issued an unmodified review report.   3. The financial results for the quarter and 9 months period ended 31.12.2021 were reviewed by another firm of Chartered Accountants along with one of the joint auditors i.e. M/s Shridhar &amp; Associates, Chartered Accountants whose report dated 03.02.2022, expressed an unmodified conclusion on those financial results. The financial results for year ended 31.03.2022, were audited by another firm of Chartered Accountants along with one of the joint auditors i.e. M/s Shridhar &amp; Associates, Chartered Accountants whose report dated 23.05.2022, expressed an unmodified opinion on those results.   4. Summary of key standalone financial results is as follows:    Particulars Quarter Ended 31.12.2022 Quarter Ended 30.09.2022 Quarter Ended 31.12.2021 9 months Ended 31.12.2022 9 months Ended 31.12.2022 Year Ended 31.03.2022    Revenues from operations 11,311.67  7,520.69  9,224.49 29,489.16 25,892.65  36,151.95     PBT 1,508.23 862.43 1,200.83 3,682.97 3,329.88  4,546.36    PAT  1,114.33 646.31    888.89   2,736.98 2,476.50   3,387.60    5. The Group is primarily engaged in the business of Engineering, Procurement and Construction (EPC) relating to roads, bridges, flyovers and infrastructure contract works and related activities. As such there is no separate reportable operating segment as defined by Ind AS 108  Operating Segments .   6. During the 9 months period ended, the Company has invested Rs. 3.51 Mn and Rs. 86.49 Mn respectively in Safety first (Partnership firm) and Safety First Engineering Pvt Ltd, thus acquiring 26% shareholding in the said associate entities.   7. During the period ended 31.12.2022, HGIEL-RPS (JV) has been dissolved on 04.10.2022 by mutual consent of Joint operators. As at 31.12.2022, Rs. 1.60 Mn is receivable from HGIEL-RPS (JV).   8. The Unaudited consolidated financial results include the financial results of the Holding Company (including 3 jointly controlled operations - HGIEPL – Ranjit JV, HGIEPL– MGCPL JV and HGIEL-RPS), 9 subsidiaries - Gurgaon Sohna Highway Pvt Ltd, H.G. Ateli Narnaul Highway Pvt Ltd, H.G. Rewari Ateli Highway Pvt Ltd, H.G. Rewari Bypass Pvt Ltd, H.G. Raipur Visakhapatnam AP-1 Pvt Ltd, H.G. Khammam Devarapalle PKG-1 Pvt Ltd, H.G. Khammam Devarapalle PKG-2 Pvt Ltd, H.G. Raipur Visakhapatnam OD-5 Pvt Ltd and H.G. Raipur Visakhapatnam OD-6 Pvt Ltd and its 2 associates - M/s Safety First (Partnership Firm) and Safety First Engineering Pvt Ltd.   9. The above unaudited consolidated financial results of the Group are available on the Company's website and also on the website of BSE, where the equity shares and NCD of the Company are listed and NSE where the equity shares of the Company are listed.   10. Previous period figures have been re-grouped / re-classified wherever necessary, to conform to current period's classification.   11. Refer Annexure 1 and Annexure 2 for disclosure required pursuant to Regulation 52(4) and 54(2) of SEBI (LODR) Regulations, 2015 (as amended).</in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock>
